 "text": "Hey! How's your day been so far? Clean them under the tap with little bit of soap if they smell, or dip them in water based cleaner if you worry about water. Then using toothbrush to brush them? That's not a good idea. Water can wear down the grease that keeps the bristles in the handle from wearing out. You can try using a little oil where the bristles touch the handle, and then gently turn them in all the easy directions. Then leave them overnight still in the pot.",
